Description: Dynamic wallpaper effect plugin for Deepin Control Center
 Deepin Meme Plugin enables interactive animated wallpaper effects on the
 Deepin/UOS desktop. When the user performs file operations (delete, create,
 rename, move, copy) on the desktop, themed character animation effects are
 played at the file's coordinate position.
 .
 This package contains:
  * The control center plugin (settings UI, preview, theme selection)
  * The desktop effect daemon (file operation monitoring, effect playback)
  * D-Bus service, autostart and systemd user unit

Package: deepin-meme-plugin-data
Section: misc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for deepin-meme-plugin (themes, dconfig schema)
 This package contains architecture-independent data files for
 deepin-meme-plugin:
  * Example demo theme package (with procedurally generated placeholder videos)
  * DConfig schema
  * Theme package directory structure
